          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maze umuyaga uvuye k’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " uraza uzana inkware uzikuye ku kiyaga, urazizana uzigwisha hagati y’aho bacumbitse, zagurukira nko ku ngero z’igice c’ukuboko zibiri",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:31",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’isantimetero 90.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " uvuye hasi zikwira ahantu hangana n’urugendo rw’umusi umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuri uwo musi, ku murango no mw’ijoro, no ku musi wakurikiye, abantu barasohoka begeranya inkware. Nta n’umwe yegeranije iziri musi y’ingero homeru icumi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11:32",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ni nk’itoni 1,8.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " baraheza bazisanza ku mpande zose z’aho bacumbitse kugira ngo zume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariko igihe inyama zari zikiri mu menyo yabo batarazimira, ishavu ry’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " riraziriringa, ashavurira abantu, abateza icago gikomeye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko aho hantu baca bahita Kiburoti Hatava bisigura “imva z’abipfuje inyama” kuko ari ho bahamvye abari bipfuje inyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.11.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
